{"id":"level-up-2026-10-28","name":"2026-10-28 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2001","en":"The college will subsidise travel for students attending the conference.","zh":"学院将为参加会议的学生补贴交通费用。","note":"subsidise · 津贴， 资助 · subsidise travel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2002","en":"His vulgar joke made several guests uncomfortable during dinner.","zh":"晚餐时，他粗俗的笑话让几位客人感到不自在。","note":"vulgar · 庸俗的， 粗俗的， 下流的， 缺乏教养的； 大众的， 通俗的 · a vulgar joke","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2003","en":"The exhibition examines an environmental catastrophe that transformed the valley.","zh":"这个展览探讨了一场改变山谷的环境灾难。","note":"catastrophe · 大灾难 · an environmental catastrophe","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2004","en":"The tutor gave us extra time to finish the exercise.","zh":"导师给了我们额外时间完成练习。","note":"extra · 额外地， 另外； 特别地；额外的；特别的 · extra time","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2005","en":"The actor used small gestures to convey the character's uncertainty.","zh":"演员用细微的动作表达了这个人物的不确定感。","note":"convey · 传送， 运送； 表达， 传递 · convey emotion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2006","en":"The practical design allows visitors to move easily between galleries.","zh":"这个实用的设计让访客可以方便地在展厅间移动。","note":"design · 设计； 谋划， 构思；设计，构想；图样，图案；企图，图谋 · a practical design","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2007","en":"A flood victim described losing his workshop during the storm.","zh":"一位洪灾受害者描述了他在风暴中失去车间的经历。","note":"victim · 牺牲者； 受害者 · a flood victim","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2008","en":"The gardener explained how soil aeration can improve growing conditions.","zh":"园丁解释了土壤通气如何改善生长条件。","note":"aeration · 通风 · soil aeration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2009","en":"The organisation promised fair remuneration for the translators' work.","zh":"该组织承诺为翻译人员的工作支付公平报酬。","note":"remuneration · 报酬 · fair remuneration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2010","en":"The final design was checked for conformity with the agreed specifications.","zh":"最终设计经过检查，以确定其符合约定的规格。","note":"conformity · 符合， 一致 · conformity with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2011","en":"The students sketched an animal skull during the biology lesson.","zh":"学生们在生物课上画了一幅动物颅骨素描。","note":"skull · 颅骨； 脑袋 · an animal skull","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2012","en":"Waste from the damaged pipe could contaminate the nearby stream.","zh":"破损管道中的废物可能污染附近的溪流。","note":"contaminate · 污染 · contaminate water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2013","en":"We followed a narrow lane down to the harbour.","zh":"我们沿着一条狭窄的小巷下到港口。","note":"lane · 小巷； 行车道 · a narrow lane","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2014","en":"The fox is a natural predator of several small mammals.","zh":"狐狸是几种小型哺乳动物的天然捕食者。","note":"predator · 捕食性动物； 食肉动物； 奴役他人者； 剥削者， 掠夺者 · a natural predator","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2015","en":"The report compares market penetration in urban and rural areas.","zh":"这份报告比较了城市和农村地区的市场渗透情况。","note":"penetration · 进入， 穿过； 洞察力， 领悟力 · market penetration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2016","en":"The shorter commute was the chief reason for moving.","zh":"通勤距离更短是搬家的主要原因。","note":"chief · 主要的； 为首的 · the chief reason","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2017","en":"Cancelling too late could mean we forfeit our deposit.","zh":"取消得太晚可能意味着我们会损失押金。","note":"forfeit · 丧失，失去；罚款； 代价 · forfeit a deposit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2018","en":"She became one of the foremost experts on local architecture.","zh":"她成为当地建筑领域最杰出的专家之一。","note":"foremost · 最好的； 最重要的 · a foremost expert","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2019","en":"The course helps students develop entrepreneurial skills through practical projects.","zh":"这门课程通过实践项目帮助学生培养创业技能。","note":"entrepreneurial · 创业的 · entrepreneurial skills","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2020","en":"The old cardboard box began to disintegrate in the rain.","zh":"旧纸箱在雨中开始散架。","note":"disintegrate · 碎裂， 瓦解， 解体 · begin to disintegrate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2021","en":"Despite several delays, the team completed the restoration on time.","zh":"尽管有几次延误，团队仍按时完成了修复工作。","note":"despite · 不管， 尽管 · despite difficulties","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2022","en":"The museum stayed closed for three consecutive days.","zh":"博物馆连续关闭了三天。","note":"consecutive · 连续不断的， 连贯的 · consecutive days","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2023","en":"The seminar examined cultural assimilation through several families' personal histories.","zh":"研讨会通过几个家庭的个人历史探讨了文化同化。","note":"assimilation · 吸收； 吸收和同化的过程 · cultural assimilation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2024","en":"A loud groan greeted the announcement of another delay.","zh":"听到再次延误的通知，大家发出了一声长叹。","note":"groan · 呻吟；叹息；呻吟声， 叹息声 · a loud groan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2025","en":"Students will conduct an experiment using simple household materials.","zh":"学生们将用简单的家用材料做一个实验。","note":"conduct · 指导； 管理， 实施； 指挥；举止；指导；管理[kən'dʌkt] · conduct an experiment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2026","en":"The workers will bury the cable beneath the pavement.","zh":"工人们将把电缆埋在人行道下面。","note":"bury · 埋葬； 埋藏， 掩藏 · bury a cable","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2027","en":"Many villagers earn their livelihood by making traditional pottery.","zh":"许多村民靠制作传统陶器谋生。","note":"livelihood · 生活， 生计 · earn a livelihood","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2028","en":"The family reunion brought relatives together from three countries.","zh":"这次家庭团聚让来自三个国家的亲人聚在一起。","note":"reunion · 重聚， 团聚； 聚会， 联谊活动 · a family reunion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2029","en":"The rooftop café offers a fantastic view of the river.","zh":"这家屋顶咖啡馆可以欣赏到绝佳的河景。","note":"fantastic · 极好的； 荒诞的， 奇异的； 不切实际的 · a fantastic view","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2030","en":"New channels will improve drainage around the school playground.","zh":"新的沟渠将改善学校操场周围的排水。","note":"drainage · 排水 · improve drainage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2031","en":"She gave a triumphant smile when the model finally worked.","zh":"模型终于运转起来时，她露出了得意的笑容。","note":"triumphant · 得胜的； 得意洋洋的； 狂欢的 · a triumphant smile","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2032","en":"The technician checked the laboratory apparatus before the students arrived.","zh":"学生到达前，技术人员检查了实验室仪器。","note":"apparatus · 器械， 器具， 仪器； 机构， 组织 · laboratory apparatus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2033","en":"The survey found signs of decay in several wooden beams.","zh":"勘查发现几根木梁有腐朽迹象。","note":"decay · 腐烂， 腐朽； 衰败， 衰退；腐烂，腐朽；衰败状态 · signs of decay","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2034","en":"The novel follows a family learning to grieve for their grandmother.","zh":"小说讲述了一个家庭学习面对祖母离世之痛的故事。","note":"grieve · 伤心 · grieve for","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2035","en":"The inspection revealed a small fracture in the metal frame.","zh":"检查发现，金属框架上有一道细小的裂纹。","note":"fracture · 断裂，折断； · a small fracture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2036","en":"Visitors are at liberty to explore the gardens after lunch.","zh":"午饭后，游客可以自由参观花园。","note":"liberty · 自由，自由权；许可，准许； · at liberty to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2037","en":"Our school collects old paper to recycle every Friday.","zh":"我们学校每周五收集废纸进行回收利用。","note":"recycle · 回收利用 · recycle paper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2038","en":"We observed migrating birds in a coastal marsh.","zh":"我们在一片海岸湿地里观察了候鸟。","note":"marsh · 沼泽； 湿地 · a coastal marsh","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2039","en":"The unexpected station closure caused chaos for morning commuters.","zh":"车站意外关闭，给早间通勤者造成了混乱。","note":"chaos · 混乱 · cause chaos","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2040","en":"The cake recipe uses ground almonds instead of flour.","zh":"这个蛋糕食谱用杏仁粉代替面粉。","note":"almond · 杏树； 杏仁 · ground almonds","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2041","en":"The weather forecast suggests sunshine for our weekend walk.","zh":"天气预报显示，我们周末步行时可能是晴天。","note":"forecast · 预报； 预测； 预想 · weather forecast","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2042","en":"Conditions on the mountain can deteriorate rapidly after sunset.","zh":"日落后，山上的环境可能迅速恶化。","note":"deteriorate · 变坏， 恶化； 退化 · deteriorate rapidly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2043","en":"I did not recognize his face until he smiled.","zh":"直到他微笑时，我才认出他的脸。","note":"recognize · 认出； 承认， 认可 · recognize a face","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2044","en":"She used a food processor to chop the vegetables.","zh":"她用食品料理机切碎蔬菜。","note":"processor · 加工机； 加工工人； 处理器 · a food processor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2045","en":"A low bamboo fence surrounds the small herb garden.","zh":"一道低矮的竹篱笆围着小小的香草园。","note":"bamboo · 竹子 · a bamboo fence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2046","en":"The design changed substantially after we collected user input.","zh":"收集用户意见后，设计发生了很大变化。","note":"input · 投入，输入；输入的数据；把…输入计算机 · user input","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2047","en":"Small changes in lighting can induce changes in how colours appear.","zh":"照明上的微小变化可能改变颜色呈现的效果。","note":"induce · 引诱， 劝使； 引起， 导致； 感应 · induce a change","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-28:s2048","en":"The portable lamp runs on a twelve-volt battery.","zh":"这盏便携灯使用